{"availability":"available","full":"IanManske/StardewValleyStonks","name":"StardewValleyStonks","description":"A Stardew Valley crop ranker and visualizer. Features an optimizer for maximum stonks.","category":"Other","language":"F#","stars":2,"forks":0,"created":"2020-07-17T18:34:34Z","updated":"2026-10-17T11:49:10Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://ianmanske.github.io/StardewValleyStonks/","topics":["data-visualization","optimizer","stardew-valley","webapp"],"demo":"https://ianmanske.github.io/StardewValleyStonks/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:02:19.551Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:02:19.551Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:02:19.551Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T03:24:28.670Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-15T18:00:48.770Z","stars":2,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T18:02:19.551Z","stars":2,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Stardew Valley Stonks is a web app that has two main functions.","Hovering or clicking on a bar opens a more detailed view showing how its value was calculated.","Both the Ranker and Optimizer update in response to changes in various settings set by the user. This includes the start and end date, skills and professions, or enabling/disabling certain crops, products, or fertilizers. For more fine grained control, Stardew Valley Stonks also supports adding custom prices for fertilizers, seeds, and sold items. Finally, the current settings can be stored a preset for later use. You can even import Stardew Valley save games as a preset."],"features":["The Ranker displays a bar chart of the best crops, fertilizers, or pairs thereof, for the chosen ranking metric.","The Optimizer uses a linear programming solver to display a near-optimal plan of fertilizers and crop plantings which maximize net gold or xp."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/IanManske/StardewValleyStonks/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d3720d3993f2626d0631da282d0332a1b